+
+    Roland D-70 sound section: LP (MB87419/MB87420) -> TVF (MB87424) ->
+    RCC (TC23SC140AF-007) -> DAC
+
+    The three chips are the gearmulator project's emulations (GPL-3.0),
+    copied unchanged into gearmulator/. See gearmulator/SOURCE-VERSION.txt.
+
+***************************************************************************/
